{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_06C9D0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"不过话说回来，Peace Walker真的有必要用腿移动吗？我觉得履带就够了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"那可不行。你也知道，中美洲地形复杂又险峻，尤其是哥斯达黎加的加勒比海沿岸。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"密林、湿地、山地……要想穿越任何险峻地形，到头来还是只能靠腿。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"湿地里的泥泞，就算用腿走也很吃力吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"当然，确实费了不少功夫。选择哥斯达黎加作为试验场，也正是因为能测试各种地形。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":""}]}